Trading Dashboard Core Modules

This interface is built around key functional areas that support the trading workflow.

· Market Overview & Chart: The central panel displays the current trading pair (BTC/USDT), its price, and percentage change. A simulated candlestick chart provides a visual representation of price movement.
· Order Book: The right panel shows a live order book with bids and asks, including price, amount, and cumulative total for each level.
· Order Entry: The action bar allows you to select Buy or Sell, choose an order type (Limit, Market, Stop), and see available quantities.
· Open Orders: The bottom table lists your active orders with details like pair, type, side, price, and status.

